{"id":"df14955ee1f08cd3","group":"28","path":"28/28-df-spectral-expander.md","title":"绝对谱参数与扩展图族","display":"df-spectral-expander — 绝对谱参数与扩展图族","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach","book_abbrev":"28","label":"28-df-spectral-expander","aliases":["28-df-spectral-expander"],"display":"df-spectral-expander — 绝对谱参数与扩展图族","depends_on":["[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]"],"source_book_location":"Definitions 21.2 and 21.6; printed pp.423–424,427; PDF pp.449–450,453","source_printed_pages":"423–424,427","source_pdf_pages":"449–450,453","source_status":"statement-compared-local-formalization"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Computational Complexity: A Modern Approach"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"28"},{"key":"label","html":"28-df-spectral-expander"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>28-df-spectral-expander</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-spectral-expander — 绝对谱参数与扩展图族"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1c9d3a0ba202211c\" href=\"?note=1c9d3a0ba202211c\" title=\"28-df-random-walk-matrix\">28-df-random-walk-matrix</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_book_location","html":"Definitions 21.2 and 21.6; printed pp.423–424,427; PDF pp.449–450,453"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"423–424,427"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"449–450,453"},{"key":"source_status","html":"statement-compared-local-formalization"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\">\\(G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\)</span>；矩阵和范数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1c9d3a0ba202211c\" href=\"?note=1c9d3a0ba202211c\" title=\"28-df-random-walk-matrix\">28-df-random-walk-matrix</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in[0,1)\">\\(\\alpha\\in[0,1)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}\">\\(\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RG}\">\\(\\mathsf{RG}\\)</span> 中的图序列。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)\">\\(\\lambda(G)\\)</span> 是绝对谱参数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)\">\\(\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)\\)</span> 是下式引入的谓词。上确界在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb R\">\\(\\mathbb R\\)</span> 中取值。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\|P_Gz\\|_{2,N}:z\\in\\mathbb R^N\\land\\sum_{v=1}^Nz(v)=0\\land\\|z\\|_{2,N}=1\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\lambda(G)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\|P_Gz\\|_{2,N}:z\\in\\mathbb R^N\\land\\sum_{v=1}^Nz(v)=0\\land\\|z\\|_{2,N}=1\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in[0,1)\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\land\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G_N;\\alpha)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in[0,1)\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\land\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G_N;\\alpha)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0\\le\\lambda(G)\\le1.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0\\le\\lambda(G)\\le1.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限维对称随机矩阵在零和子空间上的算子范数等于该子空间特征值的最大绝对值；这对应定义21.2。对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"z\">\\(z\\)</span>，逐行加权 Cauchy–Schwarz 给出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(P_Gz)(u)^2\\le\\sum_vP_G(u,v)z(v)^2\">\\((P_Gz)(u)^2\\le\\sum_vP_G(u,v)z(v)^2\\)</span>，求和得到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\|P_Gz\\|_2\\le\\|z\\|_2\">\\(\\|P_Gz\\|_2\\le\\|z\\|_2\\)</span>，故上确界存在且在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[0,1]\">\\([0,1]\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N=1\">\\(N=1\\)</span> 时零和单位向量集合为空，加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0\\}\">\\(\\{0\\}\\)</span> 使参数良定且等于0。</p>\n<p>这里不能将 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 换成“按大小排序的第二个特征值”：连通二分正则图有特征值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"-1\">\\(-1\\)</span>，所以绝对谱参数为1且普通游走未必混合。图族中同一个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D,\\alpha\">\\(D,\\alpha\\)</span> 对所有规模生效，这才是常度数和统一谱隙。仅有各个图分别满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda(G)&lt;1\">\\(\\lambda(G)&lt;1\\)</span> 不足以构成扩展图族。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"28-df-random-walk-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]","embed":false},{"target":"28-df-random-walk-matrix","status":"resolved","id":"1c9d3a0ba202211c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；矩阵和范数见 [[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]。$\\alpha\\in[0,1)$；$\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}$ 为 $\\mathsf{RG}$ 中的图序列。$\\lambda(G)$ 是绝对谱参数，$\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)$ 和 $\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)$ 是下式引入的谓词。上确界在 $\\mathbb R$ 中取值。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in[0,1)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{RG}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb R","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(G)\\coloneqq\\sup\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{\\|P_Gz\\|_{2,N}:z\\in\\mathbb R^N\\land\\sum_{v=1}^Nz(v)=0\\land\\|z\\|_{2,N}=1\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)\\Longleftrightarrow\\lambda(G)\\le\\alpha.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ExpFamily}(\\mathcal G)\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in[0,1)\\;\\forall N\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}\\;(G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}\\land\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G_N;\\alpha)).","display":true},{"tex":"0\\le\\lambda(G)\\le1.","display":true},{"tex":"z","display":false},{"tex":"(P_Gz)(u)^2\\le\\sum_vP_G(u,v)z(v)^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\|P_Gz\\|_2\\le\\|z\\|_2","display":false},{"tex":"[0,1]","display":false},{"tex":"N=1","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda","display":false},{"tex":"-1","display":false},{"tex":"D,\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda(G)<1","display":false}],"bytes":2111,"backlinks":[{"id":"a161e3a91eb15602","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$D\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$，$\\mathcal G=(G_N)_{N\\ge1}$ 且 $G_N\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；图的端口、乘数和邻点接口见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$\\mathrm{TM}$、$M(x)$、$\\operatorname{time}_M(x)$ 见 [[28-df-tm]]、[[28-df-machine-resources]]。$1^N$ 是长度 $N$ 的一元输入。对 $q\\in\\mathbb N$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}(q)$；对 $b\\in\\mathbb N_{\\ge1}$、$q\\in\\{0,\\ldots,2^b-1\\}$ 引入 $\\operatorname{bin}_b(q)$。字串下标从1开始，$\\langle0\\rangle$ 是单比特零字串，$w\\in\\{0,1\\}^*$。$\\frown$ 表示字串串接，$\\mathop{\\frown}_{u=1}^N\\mathop{\\frown}_{v=1}^N$ 按 $u$ 优先的字典序串接。$b_D,e,\\operatorname{code},\\operatorname{in},\\operatorname{Explicit},\\operatorname{StrongExplicit}$ 由下式引入。"},{"id":"61dee9752dab3b61","anchor":"ref-261","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"第21章：扩展图、游走与提取器：[[28-df-regular-rotation-graph]]、[[28-df-random-walk-matrix]]、[[28-df-spectral-expander]]、[[28-df-edge-expander]]、[[28-df-explicit-expander-family]]、[[28-thm-random-walk-mixing]]、[[28-thm-expander-mixing-lemma]]、[[28-thm-spectral-implies-edge-expansion]]、[[28-thm-lazy-walk-spectrum]]、[[28-thm-expander-walk-extractor]]。"},{"id":"9817d6d80eee4f8c","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$S,T\\subseteq[N]$；$E_G$ 按有向端口计数，$\\lambda(G)$、$P_G$、$u_N$ 和范数见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。"},{"id":"cecb37a89b3604e1","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$N\\ge2$，$D\\ge1$，$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$。$\\lambda(G)$、矩阵、范数与内积见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$\\theta(G)$ 是零和子空间上的最大 Rayleigh 商；$R^{\\mathrm L}$、$G^{\\mathrm L}$ 是下式引入的惰性旋转图。$I_N$ 为恒等矩阵；$v\\in[N]$、$i\\in[2D]$。"},{"id":"c3290c020cc313bd","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$；$P_G,u_N,\\lambda(G)$ 与范数见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 及其上游。$p\\in[0,1]^N$，$\\sum_vp(v)=1$；$t\\in\\mathbb N$。$p_t=P_G^tp$，$P_G^0=I_N$，并约定 $\\lambda(G)^0=1$。所有向量均为 $[N]$ 上的列向量。"},{"id":"23862bee6d995eec","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)$、$H=(D,d,S)$ 与平衡替换积采用 [[28-df-replacement-product]]；$\\lambda$ 见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]]，$0<\\epsilon,\\delta\\le1$，$\\lambda(G)\\le1-\\epsilon$，$\\lambda(H)\\le1-\\delta$。"},{"id":"7e4b966bb057aaf7","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G=(N,D,R)\\in\\mathsf{RG}_{N,D}$，$\\alpha\\in[0,1)$，$\\operatorname{SpecExp}(G;\\alpha)$，见 [[28-df-spectral-expander]]。$\\operatorname{EdgeExp}$、$E_G$ 见 [[28-df-edge-expander]] 及其上游；$S\\subseteq[N]$，$T=[N]\\setminus S$。"},{"id":"d2463524bbdba63f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$G,H$ 与 $G\\otimes H$ 采用 [[28-df-graph-tensor-product]]；$\\lambda$ 是 [[28-df-spectral-expander]] 的绝对谱参数。"}],"outgoing":["1c9d3a0ba202211c"]}